# MODULE-001-T111 (1) runtime files of `advance start` on H1 (capabilities: fs, llm; deployed driver; no git repository) while running, and after exit
# captured on the pre-lane OSS tree (main 84a82451, plus the read-only ClientApi::route_table accessor), before the runtime-compose move
# bytes = the exact file content as a Rust string literal (no trailing newline unless shown)
.runtime/runtime.lock mode=0600 bytes="pid: <PID>\nplatform_uid: \"<OS>:<PID>:<PS_LSTART>\"\nstarted_at: \"<RFC3339_UTC>\"\nheartbeat_at: \"<RFC3339_UTC>\"\nworkspace_root: \"<ROOT>/ws\"\nversion: \"0.1.0\""
.runtime/client-api mode=0600 bytes="pid: <PID>\nclient_api_base: \"http://127.0.0.1:<PORT>\"\n"
.runtime/selected-provider mode=0600 bytes="pid: <PID>\nprovider_id: \"openai\"\n"
after exit: runtime.lock=absent client-api=present selected-provider=present
